### 결제 승인
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/authorize
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "cardId": 1,
  "amount": 50000,
  "currency": "KRW",
  "merchantId": 1,
  "merchantName": "스타벅스 강남점",
  "merchantCategoryCode": "5812",
  "paymentMethod": "OFFLINE",
  "purpose": "BUSINESS"
}

### 결제 확정
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/1/capture
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 결제 취소
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/1/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "cancelAmount": 50000,
  "reason": "단순 변심"
}
